    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1-3 PLAYER ONLINE CO-OP HOLY BRETHREN</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c32961d2084078bb2e1c6d3f206f7180.poster.avif?t=1727149723\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c32961d2084078bb2e1c6d3f206f7180.webm?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c32961d2084078bb2e1c6d3f206f7180.mp4?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>HOLY PURGE is a co-op exorcist horror survival game for up to 3 players.</strong><br>Play as Holy Priests and work together to exorcise evil.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BIBLE CAMP MAP</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/a1e46f55a650548bc7f5f9b4061cd4fa.avif?t=1727149723\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Investigate a bible camp for missing children and repel flying demons who possess them.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VILLAGE MAP</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c1a7df99ed6a1a4b3102489fd5f9c2c2.poster.avif?t=1727149723\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c1a7df99ed6a1a4b3102489fd5f9c2c2.webm?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c1a7df99ed6a1a4b3102489fd5f9c2c2.mp4?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Complete the ritual and cleanse a plague befalling a medieval village.</strong><br>Collect ritual items to reverse a witch spell and defend yourselves using holy crosses, silver, and fire torches against werewolves and demons.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXORCIST MAP</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c5da9053cad356c5d2fce5972e1745aa.poster.avif?t=1727149723\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c5da9053cad356c5d2fce5972e1745aa.webm?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/c5da9053cad356c5d2fce5972e1745aa.mp4?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Perform an exorcism on a woman possessed by a demon.</strong><br>Find demonic spirits lurking within a house. Use items to banish these spirits and cleanse the house to weaken the grip on a possessed woman.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/f16a345afac648d60bf42f3e99361463.poster.avif?t=1727149723\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/f16a345afac648d60bf42f3e99361463.webm?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/f16a345afac648d60bf42f3e99361463.mp4?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Exorcise a possessed daughter and bring her back to life.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/f052bd7af659c8d8d86c1567895c376a.poster.avif?t=1727149723\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/f052bd7af659c8d8d86c1567895c376a.webm?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844060/extras/f052bd7af659c8d8d86c1567895c376a.mp4?t=1727149723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Work together with your fellow brethren and overcome an ancient evil spirit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REPLAY-ABILITY</h2>    <br>Doors, ritual Items and collectibles are randomized.<br>Explore each map background lore by reading all notes and cassette messages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIFFICULTY</h2>Replay maps with increased difficulty for an increasingly terrifying experience<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SINGLE PLAYER</h2>For hardcore players only. Do it all by yourself. For those who possess the strongest of faith, and therefore the ability to take on the evil alone.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARNING</h2>This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</li></ul>",
